Collection endpoint, index, pipelines,
AWS credentials, role and model settings;
:Validate configuration and create
signed OpenSearch connection;
#30271A:Read existing index mappings;
if (Existing mappings incompatible?) then (yes)
  #472535:Return setup error;
  stop
