  #472535:Return model compatibility error;
  stop
endif
#30271A:Check existing ingest pipeline
for compatible embedding settings;
#30271A:Simulate remote embedding
through the OpenSearch model;
#30271A:Bedrock Titan V2 returns test vector;
:Require 1,024 dimensions;
#30271A:Install embedding ingest pipeline;
#30271A:Install legacy search pipeline
for compatibility;
note right
  Current search explicitly bypasses
  this pipeline; its weights do not
  control backend RRF ranking.
end note
if (Compatible index already exists?) then (yes)
  #30271A:Update index default pipeline setting;
else (no)
  #30271A:Create index with candidate fields,
profile, enrichment and vector mapping;
endif
#1D2A3E:<b>OUTPUT / host</b>
Registered OpenSearch model ID
Ready model, connector, pipelines and index;
